sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Desktop User
    participant Renderer as Sandboxed Renderer (Vue 3)
    participant Preload as Preload Script (desktopAPI)
    participant Main as Electron Main Process (Node.js)
    participant SafeStore as OS Credential Vault (safeStorage)
    participant Gateway as API Gateway / Backend

    User->>Renderer: Enters email and password in desktop view
    Renderer->>Preload: window.desktopAPI.auth.login(credentials)
    Preload->>Preload: Validate payload schema (Zero Node APIs exposed)
    Preload->>Main: ipcRenderer.invoke('app:auth-login', credentials)
    
    Main->>Main: Verify senderFrame & origin
    Main->>Gateway: HTTPS POST /api/v1/auth/desktop-login { email, password, deviceName }
    
    alt Credentials Invalid
        Gateway-->>Main: HTTP 401 Unauthorized ("Invalid email or password")
        Main-->>Preload: Error response
        Preload-->>Renderer: Error response
        Renderer-->>User: Display generic failure message
    else Authentication Successful
        Gateway-->>Main: HTTP 200 OK { accessToken (15m), refreshToken (90d), user }
        
        Main->>Main: Retain accessToken in memory only
        Main->>SafeStore: safeStorage.encryptString(refreshToken)
        SafeStore-->>Main: Return encryptedBuffer (DPAPI / Keychain)
        Main->>Main: Write encryptedBuffer to %APPDATA%/vrm-desktop/session.enc (mode 0600)
        
        Main-->>Preload: Return user profile (Omitting raw refreshToken)
        Preload-->>Renderer: Return user profile
        Renderer->>Renderer: Update authenticated state in @vrm/app-core store
        Renderer-->>User: Navigate to Desktop Main View
    end
